\end{pmatrix}$$ 
with element  $\color{purple}{\mathbf{c_{23}}}$  equal to:
 $$\begin{array}{rccccccc}
\color{purple}{c_{23}}
& = & \color{blue}{a_{21}} \color{red}{b_{13}}  &+& \color{blue}{a_{22}} \color{red}{b_{23}}  &+& \color{blue}{a_{23}} \color{red}{b_{33}}
