$$\int_{0}^{\infty} x^2 e^{-x} dx = \int_{0}^{x_0} x^2 e^{-x} + \int_{x_0}^{\infty} x^2 e^{-x} \leq \int_{0}^{x_0} x^2 e^{-x} + \int_{x_0}^{\infty} \frac{1}{x^2} < \infty$$
