{"input_text": "Question: I am stuck at this question where I have to calculate what is big O of what, 
 $n!$ and $n^\sqrt n$ 
 I tried replacing n! by it's equivalent formula but it makes everything more complicated, I can't even think about doing it by induction. 
 Any help would be appreciated 

Answer: $\newcommand{\bbx}[1]{\,\bbox[15px,border:1px groove navy]{\displaystyle{#1}}\,}
